{"projectInfo":{"name":"VXLAN头端复制配置举例","path":"vxlan","visibility":2,"categoryId":51,"introduction":"Router A、Router B、Router C为与服务器连接的VTEP设备。虚拟机VM 1、VM 2和VM 3同属于VXLAN 10。通过VXLAN实现不同站点间的二层互联，确保虚拟机在站点之间进行迁移时用户的访问流量不会中断。具体需求为：不同VTEP之间手工建立VXLAN隧道。手工关联VXLAN和VXLAN隧道。通过源MAC地址动态学习远端MAC地址表项。站点之间的泛洪流量采用头端复制的方式转发。","label":["VXLAN","VTEP","隧道"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"RTD","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTD.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTA","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTA.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTC","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTC.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTB","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTB.cfg"},{"resourceName":"VM2","resourceCategory":"终端设备","resourceModel":"PC","resourceVersion":"","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\VM2.cfg"},{"resourceName":"VM3","resourceCategory":"终端设备","resourceModel":"PC","resourceVersion":"","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\VM3.cfg"},{"resourceName":"VM1","resourceCategory":"终端设备","resourceModel":"PC","resourceVersion":"","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\VM1.cfg"}]}